pluggable-look-and-feel.diagram:
classDiagram
  class JButton {
    +setUI(ButtonUI ui)
    +updateUI()
  }
  class ButtonModel {
    <<interface>>
    +isPressed() boolean
  }
  class ButtonUI {
    <<abstract>>
    +paint(g, c)
    +installUI(c)
  }
  class UIManager {
    +setLookAndFeel(laf)$
    +getUI(c)$
  }
  class LookAndFeel {
    <<abstract>>
    +getDefaults()
  }
  JButton o-- ButtonModel : 모델
  JButton o-- ButtonUI : UI 델리게이트
  ButtonUI <|-- BasicButtonUI
  BasicButtonUI <|-- MetalButtonUI
  BasicButtonUI <|-- SynthButtonUI
  LookAndFeel <|-- MetalLookAndFeel
  LookAndFeel <|-- NimbusLookAndFeel
  UIManager ..> LookAndFeel : 현재 L&F
  JButton ..> UIManager : updateUI 시 조회
